    "notes": [
      "Operator-identified short 4086 m configuration, still used for the September 2026 time-attack event. The complete current main way retains the southern hairpin and uphill chicane; the 2022 extension and northern shortcuts are excluded. The current OSM centerline measures 4093.4 m; the 7.4 m difference remains explicit. This is an independently identified public configuration; a generic archive filename does not establish which configuration it represents. Geometry remains draft, and exact racing-line placement requires review. Start/finish GPS is unavailable for these configurations and is not inferred from their filename or circuit drawings."
